The team demo was really strong and well received by stakeholders—great job! It definitely sets a high bar for upcoming demos (no pressure 😄), but it’s a good benchmark for all of us.
Sprint planning was excellent. While story creation is typically owned by PO/BA, it was great to see the engineering team stepping up and contributing in a truly agile way. Tools like GitLab Duo really helped us structure the stories effectively.

While the team did a great job creating stories, we can improve by ensuring better refinement and clarity upfront (acceptance criteria, scope) to avoid ambiguity during the sprint.
